 R←Test_UC∆Stash1_011(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;dir;rc;msg;more;res
⍝ Executes ]StashListContent with an explicit stash number on a directory that has untracked files only
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 dir←∆StashDir,'/SourceCode'
 'Create!'FilesAndDirs.CheckPath dir
 (⊂'Hello')⎕NPUT dir,'/file_1.txt'
 (rc more res)←∆UCMD'StashPush ',∆StashDir,' -u'
 more Assert 0=rc
 'Create!'FilesAndDirs.CheckPath dir
 (⊂'Hello2')⎕NPUT dir,'/file_2.txt'
 (rc more res)←∆UCMD'StashPush ',∆StashDir,' -u'
 more Assert 0=rc
 →T.GoToTidyUp 2≠≢##.APLGit2.StashList ∆StashDir

 (rc more res)←∆UCMD'StashListContent ',∆StashDir,' 0'
 more Assert 0=rc
 →T.GoToTidyUp~∨/'/file_2.txt'⍷∊res
 (rc more res)←∆UCMD'StashListContent ',∆StashDir,' 1'
 more Assert 0=rc
 →T.GoToTidyUp~∨/'/file_1.txt'⍷∊res

 R←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
 ##.APLGit2.StashClear ∆StashDir
 (rc msg)←FilesAndDirs.RmDirByForce dir
 msg Assert 0=rc
⍝Done
